round\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Forbidden Lands\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"138\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Forbidden_Lands_781d5d.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">7.5<br/>August 09, 2005<br/>Summer Update 2005</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Forbidden Lands</b> are located in <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a>, east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Banuta\">Banuta</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32973,32549,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32973, 32549, 7)</a>) behind a great <a href=\"#/wiki/Palisade\">palisade</a>. There are large and mysterious footprints, and some terrible and giant monsters beyond the wall. In this dangerous land, you can find <a href=\"#/wiki/Behemoth\">Behemoths</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\">Stone Golems</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Massive%20Earth%20Elemental\">Massive Earth Elementals</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Spit%20Nettle\">Spit Nettles</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Carniphila\">Carniphilas</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Hydra\">Hydras</a> and if you listen carefully, you can hear whispers of <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Blind%20Prophet\">The Blind Prophet</a>.\n</p><p>The Forbidden Lands - <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Blind%20Prophet\">The Blind Prophet</a> - <a href=\"#/wiki/Teleporters\">Teleport</a>.<br/>\n</p><p>You can find there a <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Ape%27s%20Hair\">Giant Ape's Hair</a> used in <a href=\"#/quest/the-ape-city-quest\">The Ape City Quest</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Forbidden Lands' ground level creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\"><img alt=\"Snake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Snake_193217.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">Snake</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">15</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">9 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">8 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">1 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table no-results\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>This creature drops no loot.</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: cen